    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it feels futile. why am i even trying to find a \"new\" me? there is no new me. the one that made sense, the one that people actually connected with... that person is gone. it's like trying to reboot a computer after the hard drive has been completely fried. you can press all the buttons you want but nothing is ever going to load. it just feels like i'm occupying space while waiting for the rest of me to catch up and vanish.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
